{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01653","headline":"杂曲歌辞 苦热行 · 僧皎然","name":"杂曲歌辞 苦热行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六月金数伏，兹辰日在庚。\n炎曦曝肌肤，毒雾昏檐楹。\n安得奋翅翮，超遥出云征。\n不知天地心，如何匠生成。\n火德烧百卉，瑶草不及荣。\n省客当此时，忽贻怀中琼。\n捧翫烦袂涤，啸歌美风生。\n迟君佐元气，调使四序平。\n中令霜不祆，火余气常贞。\n江南诗骚客，休吟苦热行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}